## 1. Genuine regression found and fixed during this evidence pass

`packages/ai-parrot/tests/outputs/test_legacy_deprecation.py::TestLegacyDeprecationWarnings::test_infographic_html_path_only_warns`
was asserting the OLD FEAT-273 behavior (unconditional DeprecationWarning on
the infographic-HTML lane) that TASK-2856 intentionally removed as part of
FEAT-527's "dual-emit forever" contract (spec §5 G7 amendment). This was a
gap missed during TASK-2856; fixed here as a TASK-2869 companion fix.

Renamed to `test_infographic_html_path_emits_no_warning`, rewritten to
assert NO A2UI DeprecationWarning fires (was: asserting one WOULD fire).

Command:
    pytest packages/ai-parrot/tests/outputs/test_legacy_deprecation.py -q
Result: 21 passed, 8 warnings in 2.68s

ruff check on the file: exactly one pre-existing finding, confirmed
pre-existing via `git diff` (my edit only touched the test method body,
lines 59-73; the flagged `import contextlib` at line 101 sits in a
pre-existing "small helpers" section untouched by this change):

    E402 Module level import not at top of file
       --> packages/ai-parrot/tests/outputs/test_legacy_deprecation.py:101:1

